### Local Configuration ###
# application-local.properties contains real credentials and must stay ignored.
# application-prod.properties is committed because it only contains
# environment variable placeholders (${DB_URL}, ${GEMINI_API_KEY}, etc.)
# and must be present in the Docker image at runtime.
src/main/resources/application-local.properties

